# --- Added 2026-09-10 -------------------------------------------------------
# The B2C revenue reset. Proves the four rules in that change that carry real
# money or real clinical risk, each in BOTH directions -- asserting only that
# something is refused proves nothing when the mechanism is refusing everyone,
# which is how this platform once shipped a doctor-escalation gate that
# resolved false for every patient with its tests green.
b2c_revenue_reset_invariants.sql

# --- Added 2026-09-10 (second pass) -----------------------------------------
