# patient could read commission rates and partner contact details. Proves the
# table is closed to patients, that the directory view they read instead still
# works AND still carries the licence number (deliberately patient-visible), and
# that the admin console is not broken by the lockdown.
specialist_providers_commercial_columns_hidden.sql

